Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: nt35596s: prepare DSI host before panel

The MSM bridge powers its host in pre_enable. The panel sends DCS commands
in prepare, which runs before the host by default. On Polaris the first
transfer therefore returns -EINVAL. Request the standard host-first order.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt35596s.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt35596s.c
@@ -478,6 +478,9 @@
 
 	drm_panel_init(&pinfo->base, dev, &panel_funcs, DRM_MODE_CONNECTOR_DSI);
 
+	/* DCS initialization needs the DSI host powered before panel prepare. */
+	pinfo->base.prepare_prev_first = true;
+
 	drm_panel_add(&pinfo->base);
 
 	return 0;
